<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia stocks trading system down again.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia stocks trading system down again.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian Stock Exchange said on Friday that its SEATS (Stock Exchange Automatic Trading System) computer trading system had gone down at about 3.40 p.m. (0440 GMT) and would not be operating until further notice.</p>
<p>The system did not operate for about 20 minutes on Friday morning and about 15 minutes this afternoon.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
